*.code-workspace

# Legacy / third-party files that must never be committed
models/
services/
views/
TOGProfessionMaster_Vanilla.toc
docs/BUGS.md
docs/bugs.md
docs/Curseforge_Description.html
docs/FEATURE_IMPROVEMENTS.md
libs/CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
libs/LibStub.lua

# Machine-written session logs from the laws plugin. They land in the working
# tree, are per-session and enormous, and record nothing the repo needs — the
# durable half of a session goes in CHANGELOG.md, writ's inbox and the code
# comments. Already listed in .markdownlintignore for the same reason.
conversation.md
docs/conversation.md

# Claude Code's per-session lock (session id, pid, timestamp): runtime state,
# rewritten by every session that schedules a task.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Python tooling caches and bulky emulator SQL dumps (dev-only inputs to
# the v0.5.0 data builders in tools/, regenerable on demand from
# wago.tools + TrinityCore/AzerothCore releases).
tools/__pycache__/
tools/emulator_data/
tools/wago_cache/
